# Technical deduplication behavior
name: technical-dedup
version: 1
description: Reads within debounce window are DEBOUNCED; reads after window are RECORDED. Cache lost on reboot.

boot
rtc SYNCED 1700000000000
read CHIP-001
assert last_result RECORDED
read CHIP-001
assert last_result DEBOUNCED
advance_ms 1000
read CHIP-001
assert last_result DEBOUNCED
advance_ms 1000
read CHIP-001
assert last_result RECORDED
assert observations 2
read CHIP-002
assert last_result RECORDED
assert observations 3
# Debounce cache is volatile - lost on reboot
reboot
read CHIP-001
assert last_result RECORDED
assert observations 4